 consola y verifica el resultado.","/docs/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate",{"_49":74},"platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate.mdx",{"_23":76,"_30":42,"_25":77,"_36":78,"_45":-7,"_13":79,"_47":80},"es:platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device.mdx","Registra tu primer dispositivo","Añade un dispositivo a Lamassu y asígnale una identidad activa.","/docs/es/platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device",{"_49":81},"platform/pki/quickstarts/register-device.mdx",{"_23":83,"_30":53,"_45":-7,"_25":84},"es:_1","Conceptos",{"_23":86,"_30":42,"_25":87,"_36":88,"_45":-7,"_13":89,"_47":90},"es:platform/pki/concepts/overview.mdx","Cómo funciona Lamassu","El modelo mental de confianza, claves, certificados y dispositivos.","/docs/es/platform/pki/concepts/overview",{"_49":91},"platform/pki/concepts/overview.mdx",{"_23":93,"_30":42,"_25":94,"_36":95,"_45":-7,"_13":96,"_47":97},"es:platform/pki/concepts/architecture.mdx","Arquitectura de la plataforma","Componentes de Lamassu y relación entre control, claves, emisión y dispositivos.","/docs/es/platform/pki/concepts/architecture",{"_49":98},"platform/pki/concepts/architecture.mdx",{"_23":100,"_30":42,"_25":101,"_36":102,"_45":-7,"_13":103,"_47":104},"es:platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx","Ciclo de vida de un certificado","Emisión, uso, renovación, revocación y retirada de certificados en Lamassu.","/docs/es/platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle",{"_49":105},"platform/pki/concepts/certificate-lifecycle.mdx",{"_23":107,"_30":42,"_25":108,"_36":109,"_45":-7,"_13":110,"_47":111},"es:platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx","Modelo de confianza","Entiende dónde nace la confianza, cómo se distribuye y qué valida cada componente.","/docs/es/platform/pki/concepts/trust-model",{"_49":112},"platform/pki/concepts/trust-model.mdx",{"_23":114,"_30":42,"_25":115,"_36":116,"_45":-7,"_13":117,"_47":118},"es:platform/pki/concepts/glossary.mdx","Glosario","Términos de PKI, certificados y gestión de identidades usados en La