etes self-managed",{"_23":258,"_30":42,"_25":256,"_36":259,"_45":-7,"_13":260,"_47":261},"es:deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx","Elige un flujo de instalación y una arquitectura de red para Lamassu en tu clúster Kubernetes.","/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview",{"_49":262},"deployment/self-hosted/overview.mdx",{"_23":264,"_30":42,"_25":265,"_36":266,"_45":-7,"_13":267,"_47":268},"es:deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx","Instala con Helm","Prepara las dependencias, configura el chart de Lamassu y verifica un despliegue controlado en Kubernetes.","/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm",{"_49":269},"deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx",{"_23":271,"_30":42,"_25":272,"_36":273,"_45":-7,"_13":274,"_47":275},"es:deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx","Expón el Gateway","Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways.","/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking",{"_49":276},"deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx",{"_23":278,"_30":42,"_25":279,"_36":280,"_45":-7,"_13":281,"_47":282},"es:deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx","Fastlane","Arranca un entorno completo de evaluación o laboratorio de Lamassu en un clúster Kubernetes existente.","/docs/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane",{"_49":283},"deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx",{"_23":285,"_30":53,"_45":-7,"_25":286},"es:_6","Otros modelos",{"_23":288,"_30":42,"_25":289,"_36":290,"_45":-7,"_13":291,"_47":292},"es:deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx","Despliega desde AWS Marketplace","Ejecuta una instancia preconfigurada de Lamassu IoT en Amazon EC2.","/docs/es/deployment/aws-marketplace",{"_49":293},"deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx",{"_23":295,"_30":42,"_25":296,"_36":297,"_45":-7,"_13":298,"_47":299},"es:deployment/saas.mdx","Utiliza Lamassu como SaaS","Consume Lamassu como servicio gestionado sin operar infraestructura propia.","/docs/es/deployment/saas",{"_49":300},"deployment/saas.mdx","es:deployment",{"_240":303},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"imag